title: The All Commits card draws the lanes of every branch, shows only one branch from the sidebar, searches and makes a tag on a commit
folders: git-graph
expect-file: git-graph/.git/refs/tags/rel-1 :: ^[0-9a-f]{40}
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left changes
wait 1500
palette Open All Commits
wait 500
press enter
wait 2500
mark a-lanes
wait 500
ui move 100 317
wait 600
mark b-hover-buttons
wait 500
ui click 301 317
wait 2000
mark c-only-feature
wait 500
ui click 987 177
wait 1500
mark d-all-again
wait 500
history search Merge
wait 1200
mark e-search
wait 500
ui click 1100 180
wait 1500
mark f-selected
wait 500
ui right 1100 180
wait 1000
mark g-menu
wait 500
ui click 1190 263
wait 1000
type rel-1
wait 600
mark h-tag-name
wait 500
answer create
wait 2500
mark i-tag-made
wait 500
quit
